    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, so you're saying they basically don't work? i thought people used them to actually hold dictators accountable for human rights abuses. if we don't use sanctions, then what's the point of even trying to pressure them? isn't doing nothing just letting them get away with it?",
